  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><p>At The Bluapple Company, our Mission is to provide consumers with high quality, affordable products that promote sustainability and a healthy lifestyle, and make the world a better place. We understand the science behind keeping produce fresh and want to offer it for everyone to use, not just the big industries.</p><p id=\"isPasted\">The Bluapple Classic Produce Saver absorbs ethylene gas given off by produce to make it up to last 2-3 times longer. The Bluapple Carbon Produce Saver absorbs ethylene gas just like the Classic but has the added benefit of absorbing odors in your refrigerator.</p><p>VeggieZips with HydroLiners are premium produce storage bags and moisture control inserts that allow you to create the optimal humidity levels for all different types of produce.</p><p>FreshMats are foam mats that reduce bruising, allow for airflow around all sides of the produce, and lift produce out of any moisture collecting in the bottom of your produce drawers.</p><p>The Bluapples themselves are reusable, just replace the packet every 3 months. VeggieZips, HydroLiners, and FreshMats are all washable (with gentle soap and air dried) and reusable.</p></div>",
